      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠭᠥᠶᠥᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>güyükü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>гүйх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>GYJY-</transcript>
      <definition>[= gyi-] To run; to flow; to be current, marketable (as merchandise, commodities, money).</definition>
      <page>390</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠥᠶᠥᠳᠡᠭ ᠮᠣᠷᠢ</unicode>
